@startuml SystemArchitecture
title Pet Adoption Platform - System Architecture

!theme plain

skinparam cloud {
  BackgroundColor LightGreen
  BorderColor Green
}
skinparam node {
  BackgroundColor LightBlue
  BorderColor Blue
}
skinparam database {
  BackgroundColor LightYellow
  BorderColor Orange
}

' ============================
' Client Layer
' ============================
cloud "Client Devices" as ClientDevices {
  actor Users
  actor Admins
  actor Shelters
}

' ============================
' Load Balancer
' ============================
node "Load Balancer / Reverse Proxy" as LoadBalancer
component "Nginx" as Nginx
LoadBalancer -- Nginx

' ============================
' Frontend Tier
' ============================
node "Frontend Tier" as FrontendTier
component "Vue 3 SPA" as Frontend

note right of Frontend
  - Vue 3 + TypeScript
  - Vite Build Tool
  - Pinia State Management
  - Vue Router
  - Tailwind CSS
  - Port: 5173
end note

' ============================
' Backend Tier
' ============================
node "Backend Tier" as BackendTier
component "Flask API Server" as Backend
component "Celery Worker" as CeleryWorker

note right of Backend
  - Flask + Flask-SMOREST
  - SQLAlchemy ORM
  - JWT Authentication
  - OpenAPI/Swagger
  - CORS Enabled
  - Port: 5000
end note

note right of CeleryWorker
  - Async Task Processing
  - Email Notifications
  - Batch Operations
  - File Processing
end note

' ============================
' Data Tier
' ============================
node "Data Tier" as DataTier
database "MySQL Database" as MySQL
database "Redis Cache" as Redis
database "MinIO Object Storage" as MinIO

note right of MySQL
  - Primary Database
  - User Data
  - Animal Records
  - Applications
  - Audit Logs
  - Port: 3307 -> 3306
  
  Key Relationships:
  • USERS ||--o{ SHELTERS : "primary_account_user_id (管理)"
  • SHELTERS ||--o{ USERS : "primary_shelter_id (所屬)"
  • SHELTERS ||--o{ ANIMALS : "shelter_id (收容)"
  • USERS ||--o{ ANIMALS : "owner_id (擁有)"
  • USERS ||--o{ ANIMALS : "created_by (建立)"
  • ANIMALS ||--o{ ANIMAL_IMAGES : "animal_id (圖片)"
  • USERS ||--o{ APPLICATIONS : "applicant_id (申請)"
  • ANIMALS ||--o{ APPLICATIONS : "animal_id (被申請)"
  • ANIMALS ||--o{ MEDICAL_RECORDS : "animal_id (醫療記錄)"
  • USERS ||--o{ NOTIFICATIONS : "recipient_id (接收)"
  • USERS ||--o{ AUDIT_LOGS : "actor_id (操作者)"
end note

note right of Redis
  - Session Store
  - Task Queue (Celery)
  - Caching Layer
  - Rate Limiting
  - Port: 6379
end note

note right of MinIO
  - Object Storage
  - Animal Photos
  - Medical Documents
  - User Avatars
  - File Metadata
  - Port: 9000 (API)
  - Port: 9001 (Console)
end note

' ============================
' External Services
' ============================
cloud "SMTP Server" as SMTP
cloud "Email Provider" as EmailProvider

note right of SMTP
  - Email Notifications
  - User Verification
  - Password Reset
  - Application Updates
end note

' ============================
' Monitoring
' ============================
node "Monitoring & Observability" as Monitoring
component "Health Endpoints" as Health
component "Metrics Endpoint" as Metrics
component "Logging" as Logging

note right of Health
  /healthz - Health Check
  /readyz - Readiness Check
  /metrics - Prometheus Metrics
end note

' ============================
' Connections
' ============================

' Client connections
Users --> LoadBalancer : HTTPS
Admins --> LoadBalancer : HTTPS
Shelters --> LoadBalancer : HTTPS

' Load balancer routing
LoadBalancer --> Frontend : Serve static files
LoadBalancer --> Backend : API requests

' Frontend to Backend
Frontend --> Backend : REST API (HTTP/JSON)

' Backend to Data Tier
Backend --> MySQL : SQLAlchemy Queries
Backend --> Redis : Sessions / Cache
Backend --> MinIO : File Storage (S3 API)

' Celery worker connections
CeleryWorker --> MySQL : DB Access
CeleryWorker --> Redis : Task Queue
CeleryWorker --> MinIO : File Processing
CeleryWorker --> SMTP : Email Delivery

' External service flow
Backend --> SMTP : Send Emails
SMTP --> EmailProvider : Relay

' Monitoring
Backend --> Health
Backend --> Metrics
Backend --> Logging

' ============================
' Docker network note (replaced package for compatibility)
' ============================
note top
  Docker Network: pet-adoption-network
  - All services run in Docker containers.
  - Internal communication via Docker network.
  - External access through exposed ports.
end note

' ============================
' Security Note
' ============================
note bottom of BackendTier
  Security Features:
  - JWT Authentication
  - CORS Configuration
  - Input Validation
  - SQL Injection Prevention
  - File Upload Validation
  - Rate Limiting
end note

@enduml